<title>USA: TABLE - Lexington Global Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Lexington Global Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>SADDLE BROOK, N.J. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second Quarter		  Second  Quarter</p>
<p>			  3 Months			6 Months</p>
<p>			   1997	 1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p>Total revenues $4,745,656 $5,606,059  $9,369,021 $11,323,359</p>
<p> Net Income	  931,782    396,836   1,670,746     940,776</p>
<p> Earnings per share   0.17	 0.07	  0.30	  0.17</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income fo the second of 1996 includes the</p>
<p>results of subsidiaries that were subsequently sold in the</p>
<p>third quarter of 1996. The company has repurchased 20,000</p>
<p>shares of its stock in the first quarter of 1997 and 168,000</p>
<p>shares in the second quarter.</p>
